      "eventId": 17421,
      "eventName": "Monday Meetups at the Library",
      "slug": "monday-meetups-at-the-library",
      "published": 1,
      "visibility": "Public",
      "eventDescription": "<h1><span data-olk-copy-source=\"MessageBody\">Monday Meetups at the Library</span></h1>\n<p class=\"x_ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message\"><span data-ogsc=\"black\">Meetup at the library every other Monday morning between 10:30-11:30! Bring your friends or make new ones as we explore new activities every other week. Activities change weekly and may include: coloring, crafts, puzzles, pruning and plant care, crocheting, journaling, board games, and more! Follow the library on Instagram @libertyulibrary for updates.</span></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Aug. 31</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Sept. 14 &amp; 28</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Oct. 12 &amp; 26</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Nov. 9 &amp; 30</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Dec. 14</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Jan. 25</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">Feb. 8 &amp; 22</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">March 8 &amp; 22</li>\n<li class=\"x_MsoNormal\" data-ogsc=\"black\">April 12 &amp; 26</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"x_ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message\"><strong><span data-ogsc=\"black\">08/31/2026 - 10:30-11:30 a.m.</span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"x_ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message\"><strong><span data-ogsc=\"black\">Location:&nbsp;</span></strong><span data-ogsc=\"black\">JFL Upper Atrium</span></p>\n<p class=\"x_MsoNormal\"><span data-ogsc=\"black\"><a title=\"Original URL: https://www.liberty.edu/library/events/monday-meetups-at-the-library/. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" href=\"https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.liberty.edu%2Flibrary%2Fevents%2Fmonday-meetups-at-the-library%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cevents%40liberty.edu%7C2ebdde4df9e8417e5fa108deffb53835%7Cbaf8218eb3024465a9934a39c97251b2%7C0%7C0%7C639229350956090155%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnR